: "V9 Screen 1.png", "id": "33822791454030748", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822327_33822791507364076_4869218410311609538_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ug3g09X8miwQ7kNvwFlO7Xy&_nc_oc=AdrYPDq7bgLv0RYGqUBcnu7G61XOE0NvIpMdOOwBDy7mb_OJMaKybXcyRjnIyL9kLTs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS_z6uIKBJBlVNm6m-HojhaoZRZt0ZbJpbNjZOQ3VB5dA&oe=6AFDBCF2"}, {"file_name": "V9 Screenshot 4.png", "id": "1887058972144098", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623565_1887058975477431_2548622667185903053_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LAsr3fK7pWgQ7kNvwFYcnS7&_nc_oc=AdriM3FNjH0ZUCYPnnZC9s7qvX4ObICdHP8PZ9LhBxWKZUOXoP0V6B646312fzy37UY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTBUYL2zi2qKDnbKjLvvN-KNgBWwWowYreRZQetvW9Omg&oe=6AFDB97A"}, {"file_name": "V9 Screen 4.png", "id": "2165697133965690", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_2165697140632356_8122620618765227654_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8a7xItJZy3MQ7kNvwGi7KXo&_nc_oc=AdrAiy7lawn7nUm9a9qraXMxdEc9FzM--3H6eKJgmpZuASVfD-vH2R-i6kWYR6g-sWI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSxUKk7fzuZSDrlOiEHqcWmvSlZemTSmxrdYYhc2UXR_w&oe=6AFDC6C7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "test01_fin.png", "id": "885979967249650", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_885979970582983_5973129291003223139_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zwSrWlGp5CoQ7kNvwFYNx_g&_nc_oc=AdrDllOsD5Wz1PIQoAtXZ2JSqMajZGmYGzZmU4MImEduLIea_Zn2rBpWGEEUBlMHjHE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRcxIoHViKChfgW5Y53DJfadZgHtnykOZy2OkfWX6WEJQ&oe=6AFDC72C"}, "display_name": "Vortex 9", "keywords": ["shooter", "multiplayer", "online", "battle", "pets"], "long_description": "**Vortex 9 is an online shooter with stylish brawlers, insane weapons, explosive shooting battles and cute pets! Supporting cross play with VR, mobile and desktop versions.**\n\nFind yourself in a totally strange and attractive world of fighting cat-people and speaking robots. Is it a demon girl attacking you with a big gun? Who is this guy with a box instead of his head and a bat in his paws? No worries! Get your battle lollipop or a bubble shooting gun and show them who\u2019s the boss! Stylish brawlers, insane weapons, cute pets and explosive shooter battles are here! \n\nVortex 9 main features:\n\n- **Crazy characters!** John, Jane, Marvin McSpy, Mr Goodboy, Jess Purrfect, Hellen D. Mon, Mercydroid and Beelzebox - one is weirder than another. Customize your hero from head to toe!\n- **Crazy weaponry!** Atypical melee weapons, heavy machine guns and bubble blasters will make you the strongest in online multiplayer games!\n- **Cute little helpers in battle!** Create and breed your own pet and let them join a fight!\n- **Various game modes!** Team battle, Deathmatch Solo, Capture point - get a gun and join the battle! More online modes are coming!\n- **Various maps!** Brawl in a variety of beautiful cartoonish locations and enjoy marvelous graphics!\n- **Play with friends using Cross-play!** Make fights more fun and intense together! VR players can join the same matches, use the same weapons and pets, and experience Vortex 9 in a fully immersive way while remaining part of the unified ecosystem.", "short_description": "Vortex 9 is an online shooter with stylish brawlers, insane weapons, explosive shooting battles and cute pets! Supporting cross play with VR, mobile and desktop versions. Find yourself in a totally strange and attractive world of fighting cat-people and speaking robots. Get your battle lollipop, charge a bubble shooting gun, team up with your hog and show them who\u2019s the boss!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_pri